# EMS core

This repo is **CFS Designers** platform (workforce + projects + payments). UI name: **CFS Designers** (not “EMS CFS”). Folder may still be `ems-cfs-designers`.

Before any task: read `STATUS.md` and `docs/INDEX.md`. If `EXECUTION_APPROVED` is `no`, only docs/rules/prompts may change. No app implementation.

Product = Windows agent + manager web + API. Website-only cannot capture clicks, window titles, or screenshots.

- Keystroke **counts only** — never typed text
- Agent must show it is recording (no silent spyware)
- CAD screenshots are confidential — on-prem by default
- Invent nothing that `docs/08-open-questions-client.md` still marks open
- Minimum change that solves the asked task; no drive-by refactors
